Z||000010||DJRice||07-31-2000||11:09 AM||||Ford built a 4 wheel behemoth, and those are all over the place now...EXCURSION.  Thats a monster if Ive ever seen one.<P>When I was car shopping last summer I thought I might like a Grand Prix, but when your looking a Grand Prix GT for 25K, you think to yourself, "For 2K more I can get a 5.7L Trans Am..."  Until you remember you cant even afford the 25K for a <B><I>midsize</B></I> Grand Prix.<P>Anyone remember when pickup trucks were cheap because they were just a pickup?<P>No more, now you have to drop 18K if you want a full size 2WD, and thats with a V6.<P>Before long we all will be driving either a Focus, Echo, or a Daewoo, because that will be all thats left under 20K.||||reg||1
