Z||000014||Raydar||08-01-2000||12:19 PM||||Okay, according to Car & Driver, There is supposed to be a 2002 release of a coupe version of the Elise. It's supposed to have some sort of 3 liter V-6 (manufacturer to be determined), in the neighborhood of 250 HP. There are only expecting to import 1500 of 'em, and they're going to sell for around $60K.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>Not quite a fiero.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR>88 Formula T-Top <BR>88 Coupe (ISO big V-6)<P>"Some mornings, it just isn't worth<BR>chewing through the restraints."||||reg||1
